\[T_{\rm pp}({\bf b}_{\perp})=\int d^{2}{\bf s}_{\perp}T_{\rm p}({\bf s}_{\perp })\,T_{\rm p}({\bf s}_{\perp}-{\bf b}_{\perp}) \tag{4.29}\]

where \(T_{\rm p}\) is given for instance in the IP-Sat model by Eq. 4.11. Our knowledge of the HERA

